hadiths[116]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein do baaton ka hukm dunga, in mein se jo karogi doosre se kaafi ho jayega; aur agar tum donon ki taaqat rakhti ho to tum behtar jaanti ho. Ye to shaitan ki daudon mein se aik daud hai; pas Allah ke ilm mein chhe ya saat din haaiza raho, phir ghusl karo; yahan tak ke jab tum dekho ke tum paak ho gayi ho aur khoob saaf ho gayi ho to taeis ya chaubees raatein aur un ke din namaz parho aur roza rakho; kyunke ye tumhein kaafi hai. Aur isi tarah har maheene karo jaise auratein haiz se hoti hain aur jaise wo paak hoti hain, un ke haiz aur tuhr ke waqt par. Aur agar tum taaqat rakho ke Zuhar ko mo'akhkhar karo aur Asr ko jaldi karo, phir ghusl karke donon namazon Zuhar aur Asr ko jama karo; aur Maghrib ko mo'akhkhar karo aur Isha ko jaldi karo, phir ghusl karke donon namazon ko jama karo to karo; aur Fajr ke saath ghusl karo to karo; aur roza rakho agar tum is ki taaqat rakhti ho. Aur ye donon mein se mujhe zyada pasandeeda hai."
"3586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ko gaali dena halaakat par mushrif hone jaise hai."
"3587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do ghariyan hain jin mein aasmaan ke darwaze khole jate hain aur dua karne wale ki dua kam hi radd hoti hai: namaz ki haziri aur Allah ke raaste mein saf."
"3588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaum ka saaqi un mein sab se aakhir mein hai."
"3589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaum ka saaqi peene mein un mein sab se aakhir mein hai."
"3590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apne Rab se apni ummat ke liye shafa'at mangi to us ne farmaya: Tumhare liye sattar hazaar hain jo bila-hisaab aur bila-azab jannat mein dakhil honge. Maine kaha: Ae mere Rab, mujhe zyada de; to us ne apne donon haathon se do baar mere liye bhara, aur apne dayein aur apne bayein se."
"3591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine Jibreel se pucha ke Musa ne donon muddaton mein se kaunsi poori ki? Unhon ne kaha: Dono mein poori aur kaamil."
"3592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apne Rab se manga ke insaanon ki aulaad mein se khelne walon ko azab na de; to us ne unhein mujhe de diya."
"3593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apne Rab se teen mangein to us ne mujhe do deein aur aik se rok diya: maine apne Rab se manga ke meri ummat ko qeht se halaak na kare to us ne mujhe de di; aur us se manga ke meri ummat ko doobne se halaak na kare to us ne mujhe de di; aur us se manga ke un ki laraai un ke darmiyan na kare to us ne mujhe rok diya."
"3594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musa ne apne Rab se sawal kiya aur kaha: Ae mere Rab, ehl-e-jannat mein sab se kam darje wala kaun hai? Us ne farmaya: Wo aadmi hai jo is ke baad aayega ke ehl-e-jannat jannat mein dakhil ho chuke honge; us se kaha jayega: Jannat mein dakhil ho; wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, kaise jabke log apne darjon mein utar chuke aur apne hisse le chuke? To us se kaha jayega: Kiya tum raazi ho ke tumhare liye duniya ke baadshahon mein se aik baadshah ki baadshahat jitna ho? Wo kahega: Main raazi hun ae mere Rab; to wo farmayega: Tumhare liye hai aur is jaise aur is jaise aur is jaise aur is jaise; phir paanchwein mein wo kahega: Main raazi hun ae mere Rab; to wo farmayega: Ye tumhare liye hai aur is ke das guna, aur tumhare liye jo tumhara nafs chahe aur tumhari aankh lazzat paye; to wo kahega: Main raazi hun ae mere Rab! Unhon ne kaha: Ae mere Rab, pas buland-tareen darje wale kaun hain? Us ne farmaya: Wo jinhein maine chaha: maine un ki izzat apne haath se lagayi aur us par moher ki; pas na aankh ne dekha, na kaan ne suna, na insaan ke dil par guzra."
"3595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ko gaali dena fisq hai aur us se larna kufr hai."
"3596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ko gaali dena fisq hai aur us se larna kufr hai; aur us ke maal ki hurmat us ke khoon ki hurmat jaise hai."
"3597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Subhanallah, tum is ki taaqat nahi rakhte aur na use bardasht kar sakte; kiya tum ne kaha: Ae Allah, hamein duniya mein neki de, aakhirat mein neki de aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha?"
"3598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Subhanallah, tum ne is ka kitna bura badla diya: us ne Allah ke liye nazar maani ke agar Allah use is par nijaat de to wo use zaroor zabah karegi; Allah ki nafarmani mein nazar poori karna nahi, na us mein jo banda malik nahi."
"3599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Subhanallah, aaj raat kitne fitne utare gaye? Aur kitne khazane khole gaye? Hujron waliyon ko jagao; kyunke kitni duniya mein kapre pehenne wali aakhirat mein nangi hogi."
"3600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Subhanallah, deen mein kitni sakhti utari gayi? Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar aik aadmi Allah ke raaste mein qatl kiya jaye phir zinda kiya jaye, phir qatl kiya jaye, phir zinda kiya jaye, phir qatl kiya jaye jabke us par qarz ho to wo jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga yahan tak ke us ka qarz ada kiya jaye."
"3601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Subhanallah! Ye aisa hai jaise Musa ki qaum ne kaha: Hamare liye mabood bana de jaise un ke mabood hain. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, tum zaroor un ke tareeqon par chaloge jo tum se pehle the."
"3602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saat cheezein hain jin ka ajr bande ko us ki qabr mein us ki maut ke baad jaari rehta hai: jo ilm sikhaye, ya neher jaari kare, ya kunwan khode, ya khajoor lagaye, ya masjid banaye, ya mushaf wirse mein chhore, ya beta chhore jo us ki maut ke baad us ke liye maghfirat mange."
"3603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saat aadmiyon ko Allah apne saye mein rakhega jis din us ke saye ke siwa koi saya nahi: adil imam; naujawan jo Allah ki ibadat mein parawan charha; wo aadmi jis ka dil masjid se laga ho jab us se nikle yahan tak ke us ki taraf wapas aaye; do aadmi jinhon ne Allah ke liye mohabbat ki, isi par jama hue aur isi par juda hue; wo aadmi jo tanhayi mein Allah ko yaad kare to us ki aankhein beh jayein; wo aadmi jise martabe aur husn wali aurat bulaye to wo kahe: Main Allah Rabbul Aalamin se darta hun; aur wo aadmi jo sadqa de aur use chhupaye yahan tak ke us ka bayan haath na jaane us ka dayan haath kiya kharch karta hai."
"3604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar bila-hisaab jannat mein dakhil honge: wo jo dagh nahi lagwate, na lagate hain, na dam karwate hain, na bad-shaguni lete hain aur apne Rab par tawakkul karte hain."
"3605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kitaab apni muddat se pehle hai; use us se nikah ka paigham do."
"3606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik dirham aik laakh dirham se aage barh gaya: aik aadmi jis ke do dirham the, us ne un mein se aik liya aur sadqa kar diya; aur aik aadmi jis ke paas bahut maal tha, us ne us ke kinare se aik laakh liya aur sadqa kar diya."
"3607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Badr ke yateemon ne tum se sabqat ki; lekin main tumhein us se behtar batata hun: har namaz ke peeche taintees baar Allahu Akbar kaho, taintees baar Subhanallah, taintees baar Alhamdulillah, aur La ilaha illallah wahdahu la shareeka lahu lahul mulku wa lahul hamdu wa huwa ala kulli shai'in qadeer."
"3608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se chhe hain: meri maut, Bait-ul-Muqaddas ki fatah, aadmi ko hazaar deenar diye jayein to wo unhein napasand kare, fitna jis ki garmi har musalman ke ghar mein dakhil hogi, maut jo logon mein bakriyon ki bimari jaise phootegi, aur Roomiyon ki ghadari: wo assi jhandon mein charhai karenge, har jhande ke neeche baara hazaar honge."
"3609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din se pehle Hadramaut se aag niklegi jo logon ko jama karegi."
"3610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jinno ki aankhon aur bani Adam ki sharmgahon ke darmiyan parda ye hai ke jab un mein se koi apna kapra utare to kahe: Bismillah."
"3611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jinno ki aankhon aur bani Adam ki sharmgahon ke darmiyan parda ye hai ke jab un mein se koi bait-ul-khala mein dakhil ho to kahe: Bismillah."
"3612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum anqareeb Roomiyon se pur-aman sulah karoge; pas tum aur wo tumhare peeche wale dushman se ladoge; to tum mehfooz rahoge aur maal-e-ghaneemat paoge; phir tum teelon wale maidan mein utroge; to Roomiyon mein se aik aadmi khara hoga aur saleeb uthayega aur kahega: Saleeb ghalib aayi! To musalmanon mein se aik aadmi us ki taraf khara hoga aur use qatl kar dega; to qaum ghadari karegi aur ghamsaan ki laraaiyan hongi; pas wo tumhare liye jama honge aur tumhare paas assi jhande lekar aayenge, har jhande ke saath das hazaar honge."
"3613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par anqareeb zaminein kholi jayengi aur Allah tumhein kaafi hoga; pas tum mein se koi aajiz na ho ke apne teeron se khele."
"3614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par duniya kholi jayegi yahan tak ke tum apne gharon ko aise sajaoge jaise Kaaba sajaya jata hai; pas tum aaj us din se behtar ho."
"3615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad aise imam honge jo kahenge aur un ki baat radd nahi ki jayegi; wo aag mein aise ghuste honge jaise bandar ghuste hain."
"3616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hadse, fitna, tafreeqa aur ikhtilaf honge; pas agar tum taaqat rakho ke maqtool bano na ke qaatil to karo."
"3617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aise hukmaran honge jinhein cheezein mashghool karengi aur wo namaz ko us ke waqt se mo'akhkhar karenge; pas apni namaz un ke saath nafl bana lo."
"3618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aise hukmaran honge to tum pehchanoge aur inkar karoge; pas jo napasand kare wo bari ho gaya aur jo inkar kare wo mehfooz raha; lekin jo raazi hua aur pairwi ki wo bari nahi hua."
"3619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad aise imam honge jo namaz ko us ke waqton se mo'akhkhar karenge; use us ke waqt par parho; phir jab tum un ke saath namaz mein hazir ho to namaz parho."
"3620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad tarjeeh aur aise muamle honge jin ka tum inkar karoge. Sahaba ne kaha: Pas aap hamein kiya hukm karte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Jo haq tum par hai ada karo aur Allah se wo mango jo tumhare liye hai."
"3621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad kamzori aur kamzori hogi; pas jise tum dekho ke jama'at se juda hua ya Muhammad ki ummat ke muamle ko todna chahe, wo jo bhi ho use qatl kar do; kyunke Allah ka haath jama'at ke saath hai aur shaitan us ke saath hai jo jama'at se juda ho, daudta hua."
"3622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad kamzori, kamzori aur kamzori hogi; pas jo musalmanon ke muamle ko todna chahe jabke wo jama hon to use talwar se maaro, wo jo bhi ho."
"3623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitna hoga jis mein baithne wala khare se behtar hai, khara chalne wale se behtar hai, aur chalne wala daudne wale se behtar hai. Pucha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, batayein agar wo mere ghar mein dakhil ho aur mujhe qatl karne ke liye apna haath meri taraf barhaye? Aap ne farmaya: Adam ke bete jaise ban jao."
"3624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitne honge jin mein baithne wala khare se behtar hai, khara chalne wale se behtar hai, aur chalne wala daudne wale se behtar hai; jo un ke liye ubhre wo use ubharenge; aur jo un mein panah ya bachao paye to us se panah le."
"3625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaanein hongi jin mein logon ke bure hazir honge."
"3626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein sahw ke do sajde har zyadti aur kami se kaafi hain."
"3627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seedhe raho aur qareeb raho."
"3628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seedhe raho, qareeb raho aur khushkhabri do; aur jaan lo ke tum mein se koi apne amal se jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga, na main, magar ye ke Allah mujhe maghfirat aur rehmat se dhaanp le."
"3629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ki saadat teen hain aur ibn Adam ki bad-bakhti teen hain. Pas ibn Adam ki saadat mein se: naik biwi, achchi sawari aur khula ghar. Aur ibn Adam ki bad-bakhti teen hain: bura ghar, buri aurat aur buri sawari."
"3630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ki khamoshi us ka iqrar hai, yaani kunwari ki."
"3631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se duniya aur aakhirat mein maafi aur aafiyat mango."
"3632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se maafi aur aafiyat mango; kyunke yaqeen ke baad kisi ko aafiyat se behtar kuch nahi diya gaya."
"3633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se mango ke tumhari sharmgahein chhupaye aur tumhare darr mehfooz kare."
"3634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se apni hatheliyon ke andar se mango aur us se un ke bahar se na mango."
"3635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se nafa dene wala ilm mango aur Allah se us ilm se panah mango jo nafa na de."
"3636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye Allah se Waseela mango, jannat mein aala-tareen darja hai jise siwa aik aadmi ke koi nahi payega; aur main ummeed rakhta hun ke wo main hun."
"3637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye Allah se Waseela mango; kyunke jo banda duniya mein mere liye use mange to qayamat ke din main us ke liye gawah ya shafa'at karne wala hunga."
"3638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum ne sheher suna hai jis ka aik pehlu khushki mein aur aik samundar mein hai? Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke us se Bani Ishaq mein se sattar hazaar ladenge; phir jab us ke paas aayenge to utrenge; hathiyar se nahi ladenge aur teer nahi marenge; kahenge: La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar; to us ka aik pehlu jo samundar mein hai gir jayega; phir doosri baar kahenge: La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar; to us ka doosra pehlu gir jayega; phir teesri baar kahenge: La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar; to un ke liye khol diya jayega aur wo us mein dakhil honge aur maal-e-ghaneemat payenge; pas jab wo maal-e-ghaneemat taqseem kar rahe honge ke un ke paas cheekhne wala aayega aur kahega: Dajjal nikal aaya hai; to wo sab kuch chhor denge aur wapas lautenge."
"3639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bete ka naam Abdur Rahman rakho."
"3640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us par Allah ka naam lo aur use khao."
"3641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho."
"3642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho; kyunke main to taqseem karne wala bankar bheja gaya hun, tumhare darmiyan taqseem karta hun."
"3643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Surah Tabarak qabr ke azab se rokne wali hai."
"3644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran ki aik surat jo tees aayaton ke siwa kuch nahi, apne malik ki taraf se jhagri yahan tak ke use jannat mein dakhil kar diya; aur wo Tabarak hai."
"3645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabron ko zameen ke chehre par barabar karo jab murdon ko dafan karo."
"3646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni safon ko seedha karo warna Allah tumhare chehron ke darmiyan mukhalifat daal dega."
"3647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni safon ko seedha karo; kyunke safon ko seedha karna namaz qaim karne mein se hai."
"3648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni safon ko seedha karo ke tumhare dil mukhtalif na hon."
"3649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitne mein aadmi ki salamti ye hai ke apne ghar ko lazim pakre."
"3650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon par dhoke wale saal aayenge: un mein jhoota sachcha samjha jayega, sachcha jhoota samjha jayega, khayanat karne wale ko amanat-dar samjha jayega, amanat-dar khayanat karne wala samjha jayega, aur un mein Ruwaibida bolega. Pucha gaya: Ruwaibida kiya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ghatiya aadmi jo aam logon ke muamle mein baat kare."
"3651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare paas aisi qaumein aayengi jo ilm talab karengi; pas jab tum unhein dekho to un se kaho: Rasoolullah ki wasiyyat ko khush aamdeed; aur unhein fatwa do."
"3652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seehan, Jeehan, Furaat aur Neel sab jannat ki nehron mein se hain."
"3653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se aisi qaumein niklengi jo Quran ko aise piyengi jaise wo doodh peete hain."
"3654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhri zamane mein aisi qaum niklegi jo umar mein chhoti aur aqal mein bewaquf hogi; makhlooq ki behtareen baat kahengi; Quran parhengi jo un ke halaq se neeche nahi utrega; deen se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai; pas jab tum un se milo to unhein qatl kar do; kyunke un ke qatl mein qatl karne wale ke liye qayamat ke din Allah ke paas ajr hai."
"3655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chalo, ye Jamdaan hai; Mufridoon aage barh gaye: Allah ko kasrat se yaad karne wale mard aur yaad karne wali auratein."
"3656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is deen ko aise mard mazboot karenge jin ka Allah ke paas koi hissa nahi."
"3657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo sach bolenge aur jihad karenge jab musalman honge."
"3658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ko ummaton ki bimari lagegi: itraana, na-shukri, kasrat-talabi, duniya mein aik doosre se jhagra, bughz aur hasad, yahan tak ke zulm hoga."
"3659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muamla yahan pahunchega ke tum jamaa't-dar-jamaa't lashkar ban jaoge: Shaam mein lashkar, Yaman mein lashkar aur Iraq mein lashkar. Tum par Shaam lazim hai; kyunke wo Allah ki zameen mein se us ki pasandeeda hai; wo us ki taraf apne bandon mein se apne pasandeeda ko chunta hai. Phir agar tum inkar karo to tum par tumhara Yaman lazim hai aur apne hauzon se paani piyo; kyunke Allah ne mujhe Shaam aur us ke rehne walon ki zamanat di hai."
"3660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aise mard Quran parhenge jo un ke halaq se neeche nahi utrega; deen se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai."
"3661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aise hukmaran honge jinhein tum pehchanoge aur inkar karoge; pas jo un se lara wo nijaat paya, jo un se alag raha wo mehfooz raha, aur jo un se mila wo halaak hua."
"3662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad meri ummat mein se aisi qaum hogi jo Quran parhegi jo un ke halaq se neeche nahi utrega; deen se aise niklenge jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai, phir us mein wapas nahi aayenge; wo makhlooq aur khilqat mein bure-tareen hain; un ki nishani mundan hai."
"3663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se aise mard honge jo tarah tarah ke khane khayenge, tarah tarah ke mashroob piyenge, tarah tarah ke kapre pehnenge aur guftagu mein shekhi marenge; pas yehi meri ummat ke bure-tareen hain."
"3664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par aise hukmaran honge jo namaz ko us ke waqton se mo'akhkhar karenge aur bid'atein nikalenge. Ibn Masood ne kaha: Main kiya karun? Aap ne farmaya: Tum mujh se puchte ho ae Ibn Umm Abd ke main kiya karun? Jo Allah ki nafarmani kare us ki itaat nahi."
"3665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhri zamane mein zameen mein dhansna, patharon ki barish aur maskh hoga jab baaje, gaane waliyan zahir hon aur sharaab halal samjhi jaye."
"3666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhri zamane mein police hogi jo Allah ke ghusse mein subah karegi aur Allah ke ghazab mein shaam karegi."
"3667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhri zamane mein meri ummat mein se log honge jo tumhein aisi baatein sunayenge jo na tum ne suni hon na tumhare baapon ne; pas tum un se bacho aur wo tum se."
"3668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein ikhtilaf aur tafreeqa hoga: qaum jo baat achchi kahegi aur amal bura karegi; Quran parhegi jo un ki hansliyon se neeche nahi utrega; deen se teer ke shikar se nikalne jaise niklenge; wapas nahi aayenge yahan tak ke teer apne dastay par laut aaye; wo makhlooq aur khilqat mein bure-tareen hain; khushkhabri ho us ke liye jo unhein qatl kare aur wo use qatl karein; wo Allah ki kitaab ki taraf bulayenge jabke wo us mein se kuch nahi; jo un se lara wo un se Allah ka zyada qareebi tha; un ki nishani mundan hai."
"3669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein aisi qaumein hongi jo taqdeer ka inkar karengi."
"3670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aisi qaum hogi jo apni zubanon se khayegi jaise gaaye zameen se khati hai."
"3671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aisi qaum hogi jo dua mein hadd se barhegi."
"3672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad tumhare muamlat ka zimma aise mard lenge jo tumhein wo batayenge jin ka tum inkar karoge aur tum par un ka inkar karenge jinhein tum pehchante ho; pas tum mein se jo use paye to jo Allah azzawajal ki nafarmani kare us ki itaat nahi."
"3673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman Yajooj aur Majooj ki kamanon, teeron aur dhalon se saat saal aag jalayenge."
"3674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sardar-ul-Istighfar ye hai ke tum kaho: Ae Allah, tu mera Rab hai, tere siwa koi mabood nahi; tune mujhe paida kiya aur main tera banda hun; aur main apne ehad aur tere wade par hun jitna taaqat rakhta hun; main teri panah mangta hun us shar se jo maine kiya; main tere saamne teri ne'mat ka iqrar karta hun mujh par aur apne gunah ka iqrar karta hun; pas mujhe bakhsh de; kyunke tere siwa gunah koi nahi bakhshta. Jo ise din mein yaqeen rakhte hue kahe phir shaam hone se pehle apne din mein mar jaye to wo ehl-e-jannat mein se hai; aur jo ise raat mein yaqeen rakhte hue kahe phir subah hone se pehle mar jaye to wo ehl-e-jannat mein se hai."
"3675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheedon ke sardar Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib hain aur wo aadmi jo zalim imam ke paas khara hua, use hukm diya aur roka to us ne use qatl kar diya."
"3676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek shaheedon ke sardar Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib hain."
"3677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehl-e-jannat ki khushbuon ka sardar mehndi hai."
"3678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehl-e-jannat ki aurton ki sardar chaar hain: Maryam, Fatima, Khadija aur Aasiya."
"3679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Charne wala janwar nuqsan se bari hai, kunwan nuqsan se bari hai, kaan nuqsan se bari hai; aur dafan-khazanay mein paanchwan hai."
"3680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bewa aur miskeen par daudne wala Allah ke raaste mein jihad karne wale ya raat ko qayam karne wale din ko roza rakhne wale jaise hai."
"3681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab'a Masani Fatiha-tul-Kitaab hai."
"3682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo sajda jo Suad mein hai, Dawood ne tauba ke liye kiya aur ham use shukr ke liye karte hain."
"3683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sehri khana barkat hai; pas use na chhoro chahe tum mein se koi paani ka ghoont pi le; kyunke Allah aur us ke farishte sehri karne walon par durood bhejte hain."
"3684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shalwar us ke liye hai jo tehband na paye; aur moza us ke liye hai jo joote na paye."
"3685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush-naseeb wo hai jo apni maa ke pet mein khush-naseeb hua; aur bad-naseeb wo hai jo apni maa ke pet mein bad-naseeb hua."
"3686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safar azab ka tukra hai: tum mein se har aik ko us ke khane, peene aur neend se rokta hai; pas jab tum mein se koi apne chehre se apni haajat poori kar le to apne ghar walon ki taraf laut-ne mein jaldi kare."
"3687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neeche wala narm-tar hai."
"3688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sakeenat ae Allah ke bando, sakeenat."
"3689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sakeenat bakriyon walon mein hai."
"3690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haamila ke pet ke bachche mein salaf sood hai."
"3691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sil shahadat hai."
"3692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achchi waza'-qata', tahammul aur miyana-ravi nabuwat ke chaubees hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"3693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sun-na aur itaat karna musalman aadmi par haq hai us mein jo use pasand ho ya napasand, jab tak use nafarmani ka hukm na diya jaye; phir jab use nafarmani ka hukm diya jaye to us par na sun-na hai na itaat."
"3694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Billi ghar walon mein se hai aur wo tum par ghumne wali madaon ya ghumne walon mein se hai."
"3695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Miswak munh ke liye taharat hai aur Rab ke liye raza hai."
"3696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Miswak munh ko khushbudar karti hai aur Rab ko raazi karti hai."
"3697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salam Allah ke naamon mein se aik naam hai jise Allah ne zameen mein rakha; pas use apne darmiyan phailao; kyunke musalman aadmi jab qaum par se guzre aur unhein salam kare aur wo use jawab dein to use un par fazeelat ka darja hota hai is wajah se ke us ne unhein salam yaad dilaya; phir agar wo use jawab na dein to use wo jawab deta hai jo un se behtar aur paakeeza-tar hai."
"3698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Assalamu alaikum ae momin qaum ke ghar; aur ham inshaAllah tum se milne wale hain; maine chaha ke ham ne apne bhaiyon ko dekha hota. Sahaba ne kaha: Kiya ham aap ke bhai nahi? Aap ne farmaya: Balke tum mere sahabi ho; aur hamare bhai wo jo abhi nahi aaye. Sahaba ne kaha: Aap apni ummat mein se jo abhi nahi aaye unhein kaise pehchanenge? Aap ne farmaya: Batayo agar kisi aadmi ke safaid peshani aur safaid haath-pair wale ghore hon kaale mail ghoro ke darmiyan, kiya wo apne ghoron ko nahi pehchanega? Sahaba ne kaha: Kyun nahi; aap ne farmaya: Pas wo qayamat ke din wuzu ke asar se roshan peshani aur roshan haath-pair wale aayenge; aur main hauz par un ka pesh-rau hun. Khabardar, mardon ko mere hauz se aise hataya jayega jaise bhatki hui oontni hatayi jati hai; main unhein pukarunga: Aao, aao; to kaha jayega: Unhon ne tumhare baad tabdeel kar diya; to main kahunga: Doori ho, doori ho, doori ho."
"3699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salam sawal se pehle hai; pas jo tumhein salam se pehle sawal se shuru kare to use jawab na do."
"3700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sardar Allah hai."
